Description: make CommandThread cooperative-stop safe and V\OS-typed
 Two adaptations in the same class:
 - the read-line error path used kill_thread(pipeThread), which on V\OS
   kills the whole team instead of one thread; close the pipe's read end
   first (the child's next write then fails and it ends) and reap with
   wait_for_thread, the close-then-wait recipe.
 - BObjectList now carries ownership as a template parameter, so the
   owning argument list and every CommandThread signature that mentions
   it move to BObjectList<BString, true>; every external caller passes
   NULL, so no call site changes.
Author: VitruvianOS Packagers <maintainers@v-os.dev>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/BurnItNow
